        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/fbbcaf6/2026-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells.py#L80-L85> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-14-odonata-audit-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells-repro-package-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
